# F10-24 lab session: start the module, fly, read its topic, change its parameter
tilt_guard status
tilt_guard start
tilt_guard start
sim run 3.0
tilt_guard status
listener tilt_status
param show TG_MAX_TILT
param set TG_MAX_TILT 20
sim run 2.0
tilt_guard status
listener tilt_status
uorb status
tilt_guard stop
sim run 1.0
tilt_guard status
uorb status
